@page "/about"

<PageTitle>Free Personal Finance & Budget Tracker | Budget Manager</PageTitle>

<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description"
          content="Budget Manager is a free personal finance app for tracking income, expenses and monthly budgets. Manage your spending with an easy-to-use online budget tracker. Currently under development." />
</HeadContent>

<div class="container py-4">

    @* Introduction *@
    <section class="mb-5">

        <h1 class="mb-4">
            About Budget Manager
        </h1>

        <p class="lead">
            A free personal finance app designed to help you
            track expenses, manage monthly budgets and take
            control of your money.
        </p>

        <p>
            Budget Manager is a free online personal finance
            application that makes it easier to understand
            where your money goes.
        </p>

        <p>
            Whether you want to monitor everyday spending,
            organize household expenses or create a monthly
            budget, Budget Manager provides simple tools
            to help you manage your personal finances
            in one place.
        </p>

        <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">

            <strong>Free and under active development</strong>

            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">
                Budget Manager is completely free to use
                and is still under development.
                New improvements and features may be introduced,
                and some functionality may change as
                the application evolves.
            </p>

        </div>

    </section>

    @* Main features *@
    <section class="mb-5">

        <h2 class="mb-4">
            Manage Your Personal Finances
        </h2>

        <p>
            Keeping track of your finances does not have
            to be complicated. Budget Manager brings
            together essential money management tools
            in a simple web application.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-4 mt-2">

            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">

                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body">

                        <h3 class="h5">
                            Track Income and Expenses
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mb-0">
                            Record your income and expenses,
                            organize transactions into categories
                            and review your financial activity.
                            Understand how much you earn,
                            how much you spend and how your
                            balance changes over time.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">

                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body">

                        <h3 class="h5">
                            Plan Monthly Budgets
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mb-0">
                            Set spending limits for categories
                            such as groceries, transportation,
                            entertainment and household expenses.
                            Create one-time or recurring monthly
                            budgets to support your financial planning.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">

                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body">

                        <h3 class="h5">
                            Monitor Your Spending
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mb-0">
                            Compare actual expenses with your
                            planned budget. Visual indicators
                            show how much of your budget remains
                            and highlight spending that exceeds
                            your limits.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">

                <div class="card h-100">
                    <div class="card-body">

                        <h3 class="h5">
                            Understand Your Financial Habits
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mb-0">
                            Use the financial dashboard,
                            spending statistics and charts
                            to see how your expenses are
                            distributed across categories
                            and identify areas where you
                            may want to adjust your spending.
                        </p>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    @* Who is it for *@
    <section class="mb-5">

        <h2 class="mb-4">
            Who Is Budget Manager For?
        </h2>

        <p>
            Budget Manager is designed for individuals
            and households looking for a straightforward
            way to manage everyday finances.
        </p>

        <p>
            It can help you keep track of regular bills,
            monitor shopping expenses, organize different
            spending categories and maintain a clearer
            overview of your monthly financial situation.
        </p>

        <p>
            You do not need advanced financial knowledge
            to start using the application. Its purpose
            is to make personal budget management
            accessible and easy to understand.
        </p>

    </section>

    @* Accessibility *@
    <section class="mb-5">

        <h2 class="mb-4">
            A Simple Online Budget Tracker
        </h2>

        <p>
            Budget Manager is a web-based application
            that can be accessed through a modern
            web browser.
        </p>

        <p>
            Its responsive interface is designed for
            desktop and mobile browsers, allowing you
            to review your finances without installing
            a separate desktop application.
        </p>

        <p>
            Users can create an account and manage
            their own financial records, categories
            and budgets.
        </p>

    </section>

    @* Development status *@
    <section class="mb-5">

        <h2 class="mb-4">
            An Independent Project in Development
        </h2>

        <p>
            Budget Manager started as a software development
            project focused on building a practical
            personal finance management application
            using modern web technologies.
        </p>

        <p>
            The application is built with C#, .NET,
            Blazor and Microsoft SQL Server.
        </p>

        <p>
            Budget Manager is currently under active
            development. The goal is to continue improving
            usability, reliability and financial
            management features over time.
        </p>

        <p>
            As the project evolves, additional functionality
            may be introduced based on development priorities
            and user feedback.
        </p>

    </section>

    @* Call to action *@
    <section class="text-center py-4 border-top">

        <h2 class="mb-3">
            Start Managing Your Budget for Free
        </h2>

        <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">
            Track your spending, organize your finances
            and build better budgeting habits with
            Budget Manager.
        </p>

        <a href="/Account/Register"
           class="btn btn-primary btn-lg me-2 mb-2">

            Create a free account

        </a>

        <a href="/Account/Login"
           class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg mb-2">

            Log in

        </a>

    </section>

</div>
